y" alt="" class="blog-back-arrow"/><div>Back to blog</div></a><div class="blog-heading-wrapper"><img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62fcfcf2e1a4c21ed18b80e6/666b4999c7cd76d9197d329e_twysbtx9wx.webp" class="blog-header-image"/><div><h1 class="blog-heading">AI Task Manager: I Tested 20+ Task Managers. Here&#x27;s My Top 7</h1><p class="blog-article-desc">I&#x27;ve been hands-on with 7 AI task managers and used my experience with each task manager to give you the most detailed comparison, helping you choose the perfect tool for your needs.</p><div class="blog-article_details"><div class="blog-author"><div class="blog-card_author-img-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62fcfcf2e1a4c21ed18b80e6/666b4c648d3675b00c3b2a6f_T03QC2CHF6Y-U03PV20CASK-a05a828fd665-512.jpeg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62fcfcf2e1a4c21ed18b80e6/666b4c648d3675b00c3b2a6f_T03QC2CHF6Y-U03PV20CASK-a05a828fd665-512-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/62fcfcf2e1a4c21ed18b80e6/666b4c648d3675b00c3b2a6f_T03QC2CHF6Y-U03PV20CASK-a05a828fd665-512.jpeg 512w" class="blog-card_author-img"/></div><div><div>Zac Harris</div><div class="margin-top margin-xsmall"><div class="text-size-small w-embed"><div style="color:#646a74;"> at <a style="text-decoration:underline;" href="https://www.usemotion.com" target="_blank">Motion</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="blog-date"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5fcb349058268443b1f5dbdb/6320909eded8c3c89546e386_calendar-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""/><div>Nov 7, 2024</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-blog"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-medium"><div class="blog-wrapper"><div class="blog-toc-wrapper"><div class="toc-sticky"><div class="toc-cta"><div class="modal-container"><div class="modal-content"><h4 class="modal-heading">Keep your projects on track with Motion</h4><ul role="list" class="modal-list w-list-unstyled"><li class="modal-list-item">Never stress over project deadlines again<br/></li><li class="modal-list-item">Full visibility and accountability for every project and task<br/></li><li class="modal-list-item">Powerful and fully-customizable project management software<br/></li><li class="modal-list-item">Extremely easy to adopt. You&#x27;ll be up and running in less than 30 minutes<br/></li></ul><div class="button-row blog-posts"><a href="http://usemotion.com/checkout" class="button cta-button-v1 w-button">Try Motion for free</a><a id="contact-sales-button" data-w-id="3ba6ef64-ff09-b8b7-586d-06ee6f544ec7" href="#" class="button secondary w-button">Contact sales</a><a id="checkout-survey-button" href="https://app.usemotion.com/checkout" class="button open-team-member-modal w-button">Try Motion for free</a></div><div class="lp-hint-text blog new"><span class="trial-text">For 15+ person teams</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="blog-article-wrapper"><div id="content" class="blog-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Managing tasks and projects can be overwhelming, especially when you&#x27;re juggling multiple responsibilities.</p><p>That&#x27;s where AI task managers come in.</p><p>These intelligent tools leverage artificial intelligence to help you stay organized, prioritize tasks, and collaborate with your team more effectively.</p><p>We&#x27;ll dive into their key features, and pricing to help you make an informed decision.</p><p><strong>TL;DR:</strong></p><ul><li>AI task managers leverage artificial intelligence to help you stay organized and prioritize tasks effectively.</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#motion" target="_self" rel="noopener">Motion</a>, <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#taskade" target="_self" rel="noopener">Taskade</a>, <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#clickup" target="_self" rel="noopener">ClickUp</a>, <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#todoist" target="_self" rel="noopener">Todoist</a>, <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#wrike" target="_self" rel="noopener">Wrike</a>, <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#asana" target="_self" rel="noopener">Asana</a>, and <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#timehero" target="_self" rel="noopener">Timehero</a> are some of the best AI task managers available.</li><li>These tools offer features like intelligent task scheduling, real-time collaboration, customizable workflows, and time tracking.</li><li>Consider factors like task prioritization, integrations, interface, customization, and mobile accessibility when choosing an AI task manager.</li><li>Motion stands out as the best AI task manager for its AI-powered task prioritization, seamless calendar integration, team collaboration, and dynamic scheduling.</li></ul><p><br></p><h2>The best AI task managers</h2><ul><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#motion" target="_self" rel="noopener">Motion</a> for AI-powered task auto-scheduling and project management</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#taskade" target="_self" rel="noopener">Taskade</a> for collaborative task management with built-in video chat</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#clickup" target="_self" rel="noopener">ClickUp</a> for customizable workflows and automation</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#todoist" target="_self" rel="noopener">Todoist</a> for simple, intuitive task management</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#wrike" target="_self" rel="noopener">Wrike</a> for enterprise-level project management</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#asana" target="_self" rel="noopener">Asana</a> for team collaboration and task visualization</li><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/ai-task-manager#timehero" target="_self" rel="noopener">Timehero</a> for time tracking and productivity insights</li></ul><p><br></p><h2>What are AI task managers?</h2><p>AI task managers are intelligent <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/productivity-tools" target="_self" rel="noopener">productivity tools</a> that leverage artificial intelligence to automate and optimize your task management process. </p><p>By analyzing your work patterns, deadlines, and priorities, these tools can automatically schedule tasks, adapt to changes in your workflow, and provide personalized recommendations to help you work smarter, not harder. </p><p>Additionally, AI task managers use NLP algorithms to understand user input and create tasks, including automated routine tasks like assigning tasks to team members and sending reminders.</p><p><strong>The benefits of using an AI task manager include:</strong></p><ul><li><a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/increase-productivity" target="_self" rel="noopener">Increased productivity</a> and efficiency</li><li>Improved task prioritization and time management</li><li>Reduced cognitive load and decision fatigue (<em>In my opinion, the best benefit</em>)</li><li>Enhanced team collaboration and communication</li><li>Greater visibility into project progress and bottlenecks</li><li>Valuable insights for continuous improvement</li></ul><p><br></p><h3>AI task management software vs. traditional task management software</h3><p>Traditional task management software relies on manual input and static rules to organize tasks and projects. </p><p>While these task manager apps can be effective, they often require significant time and effort to maintain. </p><p>AI <a href="https://www.usemotion.com/blog/best-task-management-software" target="_blank" rel="noopener">task management software</a> uses machine learning algorithms to automate and optimize task management processes. </p><p>These tools can learn from your behavior, adapt to your preferences, and provide personalized recommendations to help you work more efficiently.</p><p><br></p><h2>Picking an AI task manager: What to look for</h2><p></p><div class="letterdrop-custom-embed" id=htmlembed_1731005125850><style>
